        <body>
            <div xml:id="d171">

                <pb facs="0290" n="188" xml:id="pg188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01 Manchuria/828: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-19T10:00:00+08:00">February 19, 1933—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 19—3:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>164. Manchukuo authorities at Changchun yesterday announced decision to relieve
                    General Tang Yu-lin of governership of Jehol and to appoint General Chang
                    Hai-peng, principal aide to Chief Executive Pu Yi, as Acting Governor.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
